<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mathomo cautions talks near finalisation.</title>
<headline>Mathomo cautions talks near finalisation.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mathomo Group Ltd said on Tuesday that negotiations were close to being finalised and if successful could affect its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
